  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Action for Most Marginalized Children Education (SAME)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This work aims to ensure as many out-of-school children are enrolled, supported &amp; retained in Primary school across Salima District, Malawi, as possible, passing through supportive &apos;transition centres&apos; as required. Seeing inclusion as a term relating to all children, this work will support orphans, children with disabilities, girls who have dropped out of school, street children &amp; other marginalised children.   Working with school staff, community members &amp; local structures, CYECE will address barriers to enrollment, retention &amp; work to create a &apos;safer school&apos; from corporal &amp; sexual violence. Its focus lies in creating local awareness of &amp; ability of communities to ensure Education For All.</narrative>
  </description>
